'''Collections''' are a system in [[SkyBlock]] where the player collects a certain resource to reach milestones and unlock rewards.

== Interfaces ==
{{/UI}}

== Mechanics ==
'''Collections''' are split into {{Green|7}} different sections, with a total of {{Green|86}} item '''Collections''' and {{Green|8}} {{MobCategory|b}} '''Collections'''.

The player can view their '''Collections''' through the [[SkyBlock Menu]], or with {{Code|/collections}}. Once the player has collected enough in a collection ({{Green|5,000}} for Fishing collections, {{Green|250}} for Rift collections, and {{Green|25,000}} for all other collections), they can see their global ranking for that '''Collection'''.

=== Collection Items ===
Most '''Collections''' are progressed by collecting their corresponding '''Collection Item'''. Some '''Collection Items''' are the base form (like {{Item|Rotten Flesh}}), which progress their '''Collections''' by {{Green|1}}. And some '''Collection Items''' are higher tiered forms (like {{Item|Enchanted Rotten Flesh}} or {{Item|Silver Magmafish}}) which progress their '''Collections''' by a higher amount, based on how many are needed to craft the higher tier form (like {{Green|160}} for {{Item|Enchanted Rotten Flesh}}).

Obtaining '''Collection Items''' manually or with [[Minions]] progresses the corresponding '''Collection''', while Obtaining them from [[Merchants]], the [[Bazaar]], or through [[Trading]] does not progress the '''Collection'''.

=== Boss Collections ===
'''Boss Collections''' are progressed by defeating the corresponding {{MobCategory|b}} instead of collecting items. The base form of a {{MobCategory|b}} progresses the '''Collection''' by {{Green|1}}, while harder forms of the {{MobCategory|b}} progress the '''Collection''' by increasing amounts.

=== Rewards ===
Rewards are obtained after reaching certain milestones in a '''Collection'''. Rewards include [[Recipe Book|Recipes]], [[Trades]], Exp Discounts on [[Enchantments]], [[Skills#Leveling|Skill Experience]], and {{SkyBlock Experience}}. '''Boss Collections''' also directly reward Items which can be claimed once.

